## Limitations note

No additional research-stream failures were reported. The main evidence limitations are substantive: Whish and OMT public pages do not expose the merchant API/sandbox/settlement contracts needed for engineering; the official Meta October 2026 rate-card file was not directly downloadable in the research environment; the post-Circular-777 BdL text and numeric Circular 173 cap were not available in the extracted English material; Lebanese courier payouts, insurance premiums, CNP fraud, and diaspora order volumes lack reliable current public benchmarks; and current VAT, NSSF, permit, data-processing, and merchant-of-record outcomes require fact-specific confirmation. Estimates and secondary reproductions are marked as such and must not be presented as verified launch facts.

